{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1525132800, "end_date": 1525737599, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:14:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41903667", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978615738", "personaname": "Elm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flo_elm/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3916, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2192, "last_played": 1703006057, "avatar": "76a454a273a08deeeea87142cf5410c9195a4662"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very hard at the beginning. It took me a while to learn what items and pace to chose best.\nBut once you survived the first levels and found some items that combine well, it gets awesome.\nExpect to start over a lot. But with every unlocked new item it gets a little less difficult.\n\nHigh replay value due all the items and characters to unlock.\nA very satisfying and fun game once you mastered it, maybe not right from the start.\n\nSimilar fun like Teleglitch or Caveblazers in my eyes.", "timestamp_created": 1525692827, "timestamp_updated": 1525693069, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41901296", "author": {"steamid": "76561198231434528", "personaname": "Dimble", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tompletown/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 187, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 152, "last_played": 1553820118, "avatar": "fffaf4e5f2a58fa54d5bc9f8e68f73a6a4501822"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game, very unique.   If you have deadbolt you can get this 75% off. Makes it even more worth it", "timestamp_created": 1525678797, "timestamp_updated": 1525678797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41899183", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061316956", "personaname": "MonkeySlippers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MonkeySlippers/", "num_games_owned": 659, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 6857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6799, "last_played": 1577127453, "avatar": "bac1668afa95440f95f4648374c80a14518337fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I never get tired of playing RoR.\nI play with solo, I play it with my friends when they're around, I play it in my subconcious.\nThe pixel-art style allows it to survive the test of time, you're never going to turn it on and think it looks ugly.\nThe gameplay always checks out, it seems so simple, and it is, but when you get into you realise you can play it so many different ways.\nKeep finding barbed wire? Get 500 of it and everything dies off the edges of your screen the AoE is so big.\nBuild for just crits and crits and attack speed why not? 100 to 0 bosses in 0.1 second, or just play through normally, trying to get all the achievements.\nThe relics and item choices let you play it how you'd like to, and still make it variable and fun.\nI like it a lot if you couldn't tell.\nSo get it, and play it.", "timestamp_created": 1525664842, "timestamp_updated": 1525664842, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_